
Concerning 2000AD's library
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

I regret to see that 2000AD released a door library with the SAME name, this
will surely cause confusion among the sysop's! It will also cause major
problems if you install the wrong library for a certain door...
I don't blame 2000AD for anything, since they probably didn't know of the
existance of my library when they released theirs... But I would like to ask
them to change the name of their library. The reason I don't change the name
of my lib is that it's been around for a longer time and I don't know if there
are already doors floating around using it.

So please guys, consider changing the name to something else to avoid unneeded
problems!!!
